      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONSTRANCE CLOCK (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.82) at this track behind Top Bin Nismo in a Grade 5. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Good form should continue. DOLLAR ROLEX (3) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (17.85) last time in a Grade 5 at Taree Super Track. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Shapes as one to consider. TOMMY'S HITMAN (4) is a good beginner but will need a quick break. Last start finished 4th over 365m at Nowra beaten 7 lengths (21.26) behind Impress Spieth in a Mix 1/2/3 on August 12. Can feature in the finish. POSSIBLE (2) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
